WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.458 --> 00:00:03.211
Basecamp is all about projects.

00:00:03.211 --> 00:00:05.547
It only takes a few seconds to start one.

00:00:05.547 --> 00:00:08.550
Just give it a name, hit create,

00:00:09.634 --> 00:00:12.637
then add whatever tools you need.

00:00:13.805 --> 00:00:15.056
Simple, right?

00:00:15.056 --> 00:00:18.018
Now let's take a look at a project
that's a little more built out.

00:00:18.018 --> 00:00:21.104
Here’s a project for a logo redesign
we're working on.

00:00:21.521 --> 00:00:25.525
All the important details of a project
are in one place on one page.

00:00:25.859 --> 00:00:29.112
At the top is recent activity
that's happened within this project,

00:00:29.112 --> 00:00:32.490
and below that are some familiar tools
that keep everything organized.

00:00:32.907 --> 00:00:34.743
First is the Message Board.

00:00:34.743 --> 00:00:36.077
Instead of sending emails,

00:00:36.077 --> 00:00:39.539
you post messages here
so everyone on the project can see them.

00:00:39.706 --> 00:00:40.832
Next are To-Dos.

00:00:40.832 --> 00:00:45.128
Add ‘em, assign them, make due dates,
then people check them off.

00:00:45.295 --> 00:00:48.840
Click it to do to see the details
as well as discussions below.

00:00:49.758 --> 00:00:54.137
There's a place to store and share Docs
and Files, a Chat room for everyone to

00:00:54.179 --> 00:00:55.847
discuss things in real time,

00:00:56.848 --> 00:00:59.642
a calendar for events and deadlines.

00:00:59.642 --> 00:01:02.937
And a Card Table,
which is like a Kanban board.

00:01:03.938 --> 00:01:07.525
Click a card to see key details
and discussions on one page.

00:01:07.567 --> 00:01:11.571
Just like with to To-Dos, Messages
or anything in Basecamp.

00:01:11.738 --> 00:01:15.784
So that's the gist, but here's some other
great stuff you can do in Basecamp.

00:01:15.992 --> 00:01:16.284
Click Shh...

00:01:16.284 --> 00:01:16.493
Shh...

00:01:16.493 --> 00:01:20.038
My Notes to quickly jot
something down or keep a file handy.

00:01:20.121 --> 00:01:23.374
Send a ping from the sidebar
without losing your place in Basecamp.

00:01:23.708 --> 00:01:27.045
Choose what pages clients see
and which ones are private to your team.

00:01:27.212 --> 00:01:30.507
Share public links with people
who aren't logged into Basecamp.

00:01:30.757 --> 00:01:33.343
Create timesheets to track hours.

00:01:33.343 --> 00:01:37.430
Click the Basecamp menu to instantly
get to anywhere from anywhere.

00:01:37.430 --> 00:01:40.725
Recently visited,
any project, or jump right to it.

00:01:42.060 --> 00:01:42.811
Bookmark a

00:01:42.811 --> 00:01:45.814
page, then fetch it from anywhere
in My Bookmarks.

00:01:45.814 --> 00:01:49.234
Instantly see your tasks, events,
and what to do today.

00:01:49.359 --> 00:01:52.362
Record voice notes to quickly
get an idea out of your head.

00:01:52.779 --> 00:01:53.613
It's fast.

00:01:53.613 --> 00:01:56.199
Like click
something and boom! You're there.

00:01:56.199 --> 00:01:57.992
*Click* boom! *Click* boom!

00:01:57.992 --> 00:02:01.579
Look through everything
within specific tools like all messages,

00:02:02.413 --> 00:02:04.249
docs and files,

00:02:04.958 --> 00:02:06.042
or all comments.

00:02:06.835 --> 00:02:10.755
Hold SHIFT for keyboard shortcuts that
make it easier to get around Basecamp

00:02:11.131 --> 00:02:13.216
See all activity across your account,

00:02:13.216 --> 00:02:15.552
Get a big picture wrap-up of
each project project,

00:02:15.552 --> 00:02:17.595
or get more granular with filters.

00:02:17.595 --> 00:02:19.180
Click Shh...

00:02:19.180 --> 00:02:23.393
to silence all notifications and pings
so you don't get distracted,

00:02:23.643 --> 00:02:26.813
And finally on the home screen,
you've got your company logo,

00:02:27.230 --> 00:02:30.650
all your projects, and the last
five things that happened in your account.

00:02:30.984 --> 00:02:34.404
And if you want, click here to see
more projects on your home screen.

00:02:34.571 --> 00:02:36.656
Now there's plenty more
you can do in Basecamp,

00:02:36.656 --> 00:02:40.577
so get a project started and experience
how straightforward it is for yourself.

